&lt;i&gt;BLACKPINK: Light&lt;/i&gt;
&lt;i&gt;Up The World.&lt;/i&gt;

00:03:10.924 --> 00:03:12.725
I can't really call myself

00:03:12.792 --> 00:03:15.728
