when I'm drinking alone.

00:08:08.454 --> 00:08:10.389
&lt;i&gt;Squid Game &lt;/i&gt;in one word?

00:08:10.456 --> 00:08:11.924
Attractive.

00:08:11.991 --> 00:08:13.092
My heart jumped a bit

00:08:13.159 --> 00:08:14.227
