00:08:15.561 --> 00:08:16.929
I am quite attractive.

00:08:16.996 --> 00:08:19.131
I think it's the
power of drama.

00:08:19.198 --> 00:08:20.399
I think it's indispensable.

00:08:20.466 --> 00:08:24.737
The setting is adorable,
in contrast to

00:08:24.804 --> 00:08:26.739
