00:08:29.542 --> 00:08:31.210
I think that's the
highlight.

00:08:31.277 --> 00:08:34.146
We all like different
kinds of shows.

00:08:34.213 --> 00:08:35.481
Just like that,

00:08:35.548 --> 00:08:38.017
&lt;i&gt;Squid Game &lt;/i&gt;is filled
with different

00:08:38.084 --> 00:08:41.754
